  "notes": "{誇示|こじ} means to display or show off something, often with a somewhat negative connotation of boasting.\n\nWRITING:\n- {誇|こ} (pride, boast)\n- {示|じ} (show, display)\n\nUSAGE:\n- {誇示|こじ}する (to flaunt, show off - suru verb)\n- 〜を{誇示|こじ}する (to show off ~)\n- Often carries a negative or critical nuance\n- Implies showing off unnecessarily\n- Used in formal/written contexts\n\nCOMMON OBJECTS:\n- {権力|けんりょく}を{誇示|こじ}する (to flaunt power)\n- {富|とみ}を{誇示|こじ}する (to flaunt wealth)\n- {力|ちから}を{誇示|こじ}する (to display strength)\n- {存在感|そんざいかん}を{誇示|こじ}する (to assert one's presence)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {自慢|じまん}する (to boast - more casual)\n- {見|み}せびらかす (to show off - colloquial)\n- {誇|ほこ}る (to be proud of)",
